    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Mullery O’Gara are pleased to present to the market 131 Corrib Road. A great opportunity to acquire one of the finest homes to come to market in this location in some time. This 3 bedroom home has been extended to the rear and ground and first floor level offering wonderfully proportioned rooms throughout and boasts a suntrap garden to the rear. 131 is nestled in a quiet cul de sac and within a highly sought-after location, just minutes from Terenure, Kimmage, Harold’s Cross and Rathgar. \r\n\r\nThe property has been excellently cared for by the present owners and has the additional benefit of a landscaped garden with a southerly aspect, side entrance and garden room to the rear. The accommodation is laid out over two floors and briefly comprises of entrance hall with guest w.c off. The spacious living room is to the front of the property with sealed stove and solid wood floors. To the rear of the property is a wonderful kitchen/dining/family room flooded with natural light and taking every advantage of the aspect with sliding doors, picture and velux windows to garden. The kitchen itself has an extensive range of shaker style units with a Belfast sink unit and solid wood countertop throughout. Off the kitchen is the utility room which is plumbed for the washing machine. \r\n\r\nUpstairs is equally as impressive as the ground floor – to the rear is the first bedroom with walk in wardrobe and ensuite shower room off. Bedroom 2 and 3 are to the front of the property – both of which are double bedrooms. There is a family bathroom with bath, shower, w.c and whb off the landing along with the hotpress. \r\n\r\nOutside to the front is off street parking and side access. To the rear is a complete suntrap benefitting from a southerly aspect and enjoys sunshine throughout the day, beautifully landscaped garden with paved patio area and lawn. The garden room has an attractive brick façade with part storage and part currently in use as a home office. \r\n\r\nCorrib Road is a mature residential location in Terenure, ideally situated within walking distance of Terenure, Harold’s Cross and Rathgar villages with virtually every amenity on the doorstep. This green and leafy neighbourhood offers exceptional suburban living that is within a mere 4 km commute to the city. It has a number of well serviced bus routes alongside cycle tracks directly into the heart of Dublin. \r\n\r\nNumerous schools within the Terenure area including St. Joseph's BNS, Presentation Primary School, Presentation College, Terenure College and Our Lady's Secondary school.  There is also a wide range of shops available in the area including Sundrive shopping centre. Local restaurants, cafes and bars, numerous parks and sporting facilities. This is a most convenient setting and quiet location.\r\n\r\nThis is an immaculate property in a highly accessible and popular residential location, viewing is recommended!"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall \r\nSolid wood floors, ceiling coving and recessed lights. \r\n\r\nGuest wc. \r\nTiled floor, part tiled walls, w.c and whb. \r\n\r\nLiving \r\nSolid wood floor, sealed stove, ceiling coving. \r\n\r\nKitchen /Dining/Family \r\nTiled floor throughout and recessed lights. \r\nKitchen \r\nRange of solid wood shaker style units, Belfast sink unit, extractor fan, tiled splashback, velux rooflight, plumbed for dishwasher, island unit with breakfast bar seating and solid wood countertop throughout. \r\nDining/Family \r\nShelved area, velux rooflight and sliding door to garden. \r\n\r\nUtility \r\nPlumbed for washing machine, units and tiled floor. \r\n\r\nUpstairs\r\nBedroom 1 (Rear) Ensuite  \r\nWalk in wardrobe and recessed lights. \r\nEnsuite \r\nShower, whb, w.c, mirror, vanity lighting, tiled walls and tiled floor\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 (Front) \r\nFitted wardrobes\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 (Front) \r\n\r\nBathroom\r\nBath, electric shower attachment, w.c, whb, radiator, tiled walls and tiled floor.\r\n\r\nLanding \r\nSpacious landing with home office area. Hot press. \r\n\r\nOutside \r\nOff street parking to the front and side entrance. Southerly aspect to the rear with paved patio area and lawn with mature hedging. Outside tap and socket. \r\n\r\nGarden room \r\nPart storage. Garden room – laminate floor, electric heating and wiring."
